      "verification": {
        "verified": true,
        "reason": "valid",
        "payload": "tree 688aaa8d5a0ba9bc5b78fbf8cb1ae2154b186371\nparent 100ba872c808946155b1eeb8c4568058f2eea0a7\nauthor Ferdinando Ametrano <ferdinando@ametrano.net> 1790923174 +0200\ncommitter Ferdinando Ametrano <ferdinando@ametrano.net> 1792966893 +0100\n\nBIP-352: add test vectors for malleated p2pkh pubkey extraction\n\nAdd two p2pkh inputs whose scriptSig also pushes another valid pubkey.\n\nIn `<sig> <pubkey> <bogus_sig> OP_OVER OP_CHECKSIG OP_IF <other_pubkey>\nOP_ENDIF`, evaluating the scriptSig with a checker that accepts any\nsignature leaves <other_pubkey> on top of the stack. This is the\nscriptSig of the test added in bitcoin/bitcoin#36338.\n\nIn `<other_pubkey> OP_DROP <sig> <pubkey>`, taking the first 33-byte\npush without checking its hash finds <other_pubkey>.\n",
